    },
    {
      "attach_count": 0,
      "attachments": [],
      "id": 19055,
      "is_admin": false,
      "is_moderator": false,
      "is_staff": false,
      "last_edit_date": 0,
      "message_parsed": "<b>pilot</b>, уже это реализовано. Обратись к <b>_Xz_, </b>он выше скрины своего мода показал.",
      "message_state": "visible",
      "position": 20,
      "post_date": 1342173529,
      "user_id": 0,
      "user_title": "",
      "username": "Gemini_13"
    },
    {
      "attach_count": 0,
      "attachments": [],
      "id": 19712,
      "is_admin": false,
      "is_moderator": false,
      "is_staff": false,
      "last_edit_date": 0,
      "message_parsed": "убираем со списка скрытых юзеров, но оставляем себя (независимо от статуса) и разреашем админу видеть всех<br />\n<b>viewtopic.php</b><br />\nнайти:<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">    $sql = DB()-&gt;fetch_rowset(&quot;SELECT username, user_id, user_rank, curpage_topic_time\n      FROM &quot; . BB_USERS . &quot;\n      WHERE curpage_topic = $topic_id\n      AND (curpage_topic_time &gt; &quot;.( TIMENOW - 300 ).&quot;)&quot;);</pre>заменить на:<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">    $sql = DB()-&gt;fetch_rowset(&quot;SELECT username, user_id, user_opt, user_rank, curpage_topic_time\n      FROM &quot; . BB_USERS . &quot;\n      WHERE curpage_topic = $topic_id\n      AND (curpage_topic_time &gt; &quot;.( TIMENOW - 300 ).&quot;)&quot;);</pre> <br />\nнайти:<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">    foreach ($sql as $row)\n    {\n        $looking_list .= profile_url($row) .&#039;, &#039;;\n    }</pre>заменить на:<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">    foreach ($sql as $row)\n    {\n        if (!bf($row[&#039;user_opt&#039;], &#039;user_opt&#039;, &#039;allow_viewonline&#039;) || IS_AM || $user_id = $row[&#039;user_id&#039;])\n        {\n            $looking_list .= profile_url($row) .&#039;, &#039;;\n        }\n    }</pre>",
      "message_state": "visible",
      "position": 21,
      "post_date": 1344626889,
      "user_id": 0,
      "user_title": "",
      "username": "Gemini_13"
    },
    {
      "attach_count": 0,
      "attachments": [],
      "id": 19715,
      "is_admin": false,
      "is_moderator": false,
      "is_staff": false,
      "last_edit_date": 0,
      "message_parsed": "А это в теории должно избавить от мертвых душ в темах... Говорю &quot;в теории&quot;, ибо тестить особо некогда.<br />\nнайти:<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">DB()-&gt;query(&quot;UPDATE &quot;. BB_USERS .&quot; SET curpage_topic = $topic_id, curpage_topic_time = &quot;. TIMENOW .&quot; WHERE user_id = $user_id&quot;);</pre>вставить до:<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">        if ($post_id)\n        {\n            $topic = DB()-&gt;fetch_row(&quot;SELECT topic_id FROM bb_posts WHERE post_id = $post_id&quot;);\n            $topic_id = $topic[&#039;topic_id&#039;];\n        }</pre>Хотя этого все-равно мало, ибо надо фильтровать на скрытые топики.<br />\n <br />\n------------------------------<br />\nUPDATE: Был косяк с перемнной тут. Чтобы не флудить, весь кусок<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">$user_id = $userdata[&#039;user_id&#039;];\nif ($user_id &gt; 0)\n{\n    $topic = $topic_id;\n    if ($user_id)\n    {\n        if ($post_id)\n        {\n            $sql = &quot;SELECT topic_id FROM bb_posts WHERE post_id = $post_id&quot;;\n            if ($row = DB()-&gt;fetch_row($sql))\n            {\n                $topic = $row[&#039;topic_id&#039;];\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                $topic = 0;\n            }\n        }\n \n        DB()-&gt;query(&quot;UPDATE &quot;. BB_USERS .&quot; SET curpage_topic = $topic, curpage_topic_time = &quot;. TIMENOW .&quot; WHERE user_id = $user_id&quot;);\n    }\n   \n    $sql = DB()-&gt;fetch_rowset(&quot;SELECT username, user_id, user_opt, user_rank, curpage_topic_time\n      FROM &quot; . BB_USERS . &quot;\n      WHERE curpage_topic = $topic\n      AND (curpage_topic_time &gt; &quot;.( TIMENOW - 300 ).&quot;)&quot;);\n \n    $looking_list = &#039;&#039;;\n    foreach ($sql as $row)\n    {\n        if (!bf($row[&#039;user_opt&#039;], &#039;user_opt&#039;, &#039;allow_viewonline&#039;) || IS_AM || $user_id = $row[&#039;user_id&#039;])\n        {\n            $looking_list .= profile_url($row) .&#039;, &#039;;\n        }\n    }\n    $looking_list = substr($looking_list,0,strlen($looking_list)-2);\n   \n    $template-&gt;assign_vars(array(\n      &#039;LOOKING_LIST&#039; =&gt; $lang[&#039;WHOIS_LOOKING&#039;] . &#039;&amp;nbsp; &#039; . $looking_list,\n    ));\n}</pre>",
